### Virheellinen varaus - ei lippuja
POST http://localhost:8080/api/liput/varaa
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{myyjaToken}}

{
  "tapahtumaId": 1,
  "liput": []
}

### Virheellinen varaus - negatiivinen määrä
POST http://localhost:8080/api/liput/varaa
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{myyjaToken}}

{
  "tapahtumaId": 1,
  "liput": [
    {
      "lipputyyppiId": 1,
      "qty": -2
    }
  ]
}

### Lunasta lippu
POST http://localhost:8080/api/liput/lunasta
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{myyjaToken}}

{
  "koodi": "ABCDEF-123456"
}

### Lunasta lippu, jota ei ole
POST http://localhost:8080/api/liput/lunasta
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{myyjaToken}}

{
  "koodi": "EI-OLEMASSA-123"
}

### Lunasta lippu, joka on lunastettu
POST http://localhost:8080/api/liput/lunasta
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{myyjaToken}}

